        <mxCell id="tools-content3" value="• False Positive Rate (误报率) &lt; 5%&#xa;• Fraud Detection Rate (检出率) &gt; 85%&#xa;• Precision / Recall / F1-Score&#xa;• 业务影响: 损失金额 / 总交易额&#xa;• 用户体验: Challenge Rate &lt; 2%" style="text;fontSize=15;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;opacity=95;" parent="1" vertex="1">
